      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started hitting the gym a few weeks ago but im not really sure what im doing. i want to get stronger and actually see some progress. can u make me a simple 4 week program for a beginner? i wanna focus on the big stuff like squats, bench, and deadlifts. just something with linear progression so i can track my lifts. thanks",
